---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Feedback">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Already used Aya &amp; Sura with your family?</h1>
      <p>We are reconnecting with families who have already used Aya &amp; Sura products so we can learn what children actually enjoyed, what parents found useful and what we should build next. Honest feedback is more valuable than praise.</p>

      <form class="card" style="max-width:640px;margin-top:1.5rem;" data-mock="true" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); this.querySelector('[data-status]').textContent='Thanks for sharing — this staging form is not yet connected to a live inbox.';">
        <div class="grid" style="gap:1rem;">
          <label>Name (optional)
            <input type="text" name="name" />
          </label>
          <label>Email
            <input type="email" name="email" required />
          </label>
          <label>Which product did you use?
            <input type="text" name="product" />
          </label>
          <label>Approximate child age range
            <input type="text" name="age_range" />
          </label>
          <label>What did your child enjoy most?
            <textarea name="enjoyed"></textarea>
          </label>
          <label>Did you use the QR/audio?
            <select name="used_audio"><option>Yes</option><option>No</option><option>Not sure</option></select>
          </label>
          <label>Did you try any card games?
            <select name="tried_games"><option>Yes</option><option>No</option></select>
          </label>
          <label>What was confusing or could be better?
            <textarea name="confusing"></textarea>
          </label>
          <label>What would you like Aya &amp; Sura to make next?
            <textarea name="next"></textarea>
          </label>
          <label>May we contact you about your feedback?
            <select name="contact_ok"><option>Yes</option><option>No</option></select>
          </label>
        </div>
        <button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit" style="margin-top:1.5rem;">Share Your Experience</button>
        <p data-status class="muted" style="margin-top:.75rem;"></p>
      </form>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">We do not ask for your child's name. Submissions are reviewed before any quote is ever published — see content/outreach for the testimonial permission workflow.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  label { display: grid; gap: .35rem; font-weight: 600; font-size: .9rem; }
  input, textarea, select {
    padding: .7em .9em;
    border-radius: var(--radius-small);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }
  textarea { min-height: 5em; }
</style>
